The SPEED+ dataset (Park, Märtens, Lecuyer, Izzo & D'Amico) is distributed under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 via the Stanford Digital Repository (https://purl.stanford.edu/wv398fc4383)
and is NOT redistributed here. The NonCommercial and ShareAlike terms are the dataset's,
not this repository's, and they attach to the data and to anything derived from it —
including figures rendered from SPEED+ frames and any weights trained on it (the P1
checkpoints this project consumes, and the variance-head checkpoint it produces).

Project 1 (spacecraft-pose-baseline) is included as a git submodule under its own MIT
License; see external/spacecraft-pose-baseline/LICENSE. The Tango 3D keypoint wireframe
used here comes from that submodule, which records its provenance.
